# Saving on this computer, through the real UI with no test signer: the empty
# state, the choice and its warning, the first scan, then a direct receive.
expect-slow Devimint Federation
click Saving
expect Connect a hardware wallet or use this computer
shot empty
click Set up
expect This computer
expect Keys stay on this computer. A hardware wallet is safer for large amounts.
shot setup
click Set up
expect-slow Saving is set up
expect This computer
# The software wallet is always there: nothing asks to connect it.
expect-not Connect your
# Right after setup the first scan runs: the tab says so, not Offline.
expect-not Offline
shot scanning
click Receive
# The address appears once the scan ends, with no Retry pressed.
expect-within 120 bcrt1
expect-not Could not get an address
expect Coins received this way are marked unmixed
expect-not Your device cannot display this address
save-text bcrt1 saving-address.txt
# The script pays 0.01 BTC to it and mines.
shot address
close-dialog
expect-within 180 0.0100 BTC
expect Received
expect unmixed
expect-not depositing
shot funded
# Nothing moves to Saving until Phase 4, set up or not.
click Spending
expect waiting for Saving
expect-not moving to Saving
shot spending
